  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "A feature release for the Dark theme, backward compatible with 1.1.0. The four InfoBar severity fills and their borders are lifted to softer, pastel tints in the Dark variant, on the same hues as the Light variant, so an info bar no longer sinks into the panels around it; primary text on every fill keeps WCAG AA contrast. The info bar message line now paints the new EnigmaInfoBarMessageForeground colour and brush keys, which keep it readable on the new fills in Dark and leave the Light variant exactly as it was. No key is renamed or removed, every existing override still applies, and no runtime dependency changes. See RELEASENOTES.md for the full details.",
